## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Cloning a card whose Fragment Title already exists in the current path produces a clone titled `<base>-1`
- [ ] If `<base>-1` also exists, the clone is titled `<base>-2`, and so on
- [ ] Cloning a card named `<base>-N` generates `<base>-(N+1)` (or the next available suffix)
- [ ] Cloning a card whose Fragment Title is unique returns the title unchanged (no suffix added)
- [ ] The original card's Fragment Title is not modified
- [ ] Manual edits in the clone dialog are not blocked — the user may change the pre-filled title freely
- [ ] `cancelClone()` resets `titleClone` to `''` so stale values don't persist on re-open

